# ====================================================================
# GITHUB COPILOT IGNORE FILE (.copilotignore)
# Restricts indexing and access for Copilot Chat & Workspace agents
# ====================================================================

# --- Block Credentials Globally ---
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.secret
**/credentials.json

# --- Block Dependency Folders ---
**/node_modules/**
**/vendor/**
**/bower_components/**
**/.pnpm-store/**

# --- Block Frontend Bundles ---
**/dist/**
**/build/**
**/.next/**
**/.nuxt/**
**/.svelte-kit/**
**/.turbo/**

# --- Block Python Environments & Caches ---
**/__pycache__/**
**/.venv/**
**/venv/**
**/.pytest_cache/**
**/.mypy_cache/**

# --- Block Rust & Go Binaries ---
**/target/**
**/bin/**
**/pkg/**

# --- Block Mobile Build Artifacts ---
**/.expo/**
**/android/app/build/**
**/ios/build/**

# --- Block Large Data & System Logs ---
**/*.sql
**/*.sqlite
**/*.db
**/*.log
**/logs/**
**/tmp/**
**/cache/**
**/data/**
**/backup/**
**/dump/**

*.prs